Niches that have neither a visible nor a secret door will contain a
teleport scroll. To get it you must dig the wall, or fall from an
upper level into the niche, or teleport, or pass the wall in an
appropriate polymorphed form. Sometimes such niches are, due to the
dungeon generation process, connnected with some other corridor and
may be directly accessed from the corridor. That's why Raisse asks...

